      "id": "seed|2958986|12",
      "text": "有採集隊從城外回來說，霜林靠近城側的那片最近長得特別快",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 2,
      "updated_at": 1775392092,
      "expires_at": 1775395692
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2958988|23",
      "text": "十一樓健身區新添了幾件器材，是用富態化木材做的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1775392909,
      "expires_at": 1775396509
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2958985|22",
      "text": "三樓醫療區最近比較忙，好像是採集隊回城的季節",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1775391247,
      "expires_at": 1775394847
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2958983|18",
      "text": "電梯間排了好長的隊，聽說中間幾層在做維護",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1775390271,
      "expires_at": 1775393871
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2958987|21",
      "text": "走廊的老長凳被根鬚纏得更穩了，坐起來比以前舒服",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1775392723,
      "expires_at": 1775396323
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2958988|7",
      "text": "聽說好事多的批發價又調了，最近物流好像不太順",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1775392809,
      "expires_at": 1775396409
    },
    {
      "id": "eco|pulse|303",
      "text": "聽說租鋪成本漲了，幾家小攤開始提早收攤。",
